// Tessera stdlib: the correctly rounded inverse hyperbolic tangent of F16
//
// Evaluated in F32: an odd degree-11 polynomial for |x| < 1/2, one explicit
// input it rounds wrongly, and above 1/2 a table with an entry for every F16
// input. Round to nearest only: +-0 maps to itself, +-1 gives +-inf, |x| > 1
// gives the default NaN 0xFE00, and NaN comes back quiet.
//
// Ported from CORE-MATH, src/binary16/atanh/atanhf16.c via RazorForge's B16Atanh.rf.
// Copyright (c) 2025 Paul Zimmermann
// MIT license: see LICENSE-CORE-MATH

module Standard::Core

